sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant MMesh as ModelMesh Sidecar
    participant GRPC as gRPC Server<br/>8085/TCP
    participant HTTP as HTTP Server<br/>8080/TCP FastAPI
    participant Wrapper as CaikitRuntimeServerWrapper
    participant Predict as GlobalPredictServicer
    participant Train as GlobalTrainServicer
    participant MM as ModelManager
    participant Module as ModuleBase<br/>(AI Model)
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>8086/TCP
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OTLP as OTLP Collector<br/>4317/TCP

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over Client,Module: Flow 1: Model Inference (Unary gRPC)
        Client->>GRPC: gRPC request<br/>TLS/mTLS configurable
        GRPC->>Wrapper: Route dynamic RPC
        Wrapper->>Predict: Predict(request)<br/>extract mm-model-id from metadata
        Predict->>MM: retrieve_model(model_id)
        MM-->>Predict: loaded ModuleBase instance
        Predict->>Module: run(input) or run_batch(inputs)
        Module-->>Predict: prediction result
        Predict->>Prom: increment predict_rpc_count
        Predict-->>Wrapper: response
        Wrapper-->>GRPC: gRPC response
        GRPC-->>Client: prediction result
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over Client,Module: Flow 2: Model Inference (HTTP with Server-Side Streaming)
        Client->>HTTP: POST /api/v1/task/{task}<br/>TLS/mTLS configurable
        HTTP->>Predict: predict_model(output_streaming=True)<br/>model_id from JSON body
        Predict->>MM: retrieve_model(model_id)
        MM-->>Predict: loaded ModuleBase instance
        Predict->>Module: run_stream(input)
        loop Streaming tokens
            Module-->>Predict: partial result
            Predict-->>HTTP: yield token
            HTTP-->>Client: SSE event (text/event-stream)
        end
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over MMesh,S3: Flow 3: Model Loading via ModelMesh
        MMesh->>GRPC: loadModel(modelId, modelPath)<br/>unix:/tmp/mmesh/grpc.sock<br/>plaintext
        GRPC->>Wrapper: Route to ModelRuntimeServicer
        Wrapper->>MM: load_model(model_id, path)
        MM->>MM: ModelFinder.find_model(disk path)
        MM->>MM: ModelInitializer.init<br/>(backend priority: LOCAL → TGIS → vLLM)
        MM-->>Wrapper: LoadModelResponse<br/>(sizeInBytes)
        Wrapper-->>GRPC: response
        GRPC-->>MMesh: model loaded successfully
    end

    rect rgb(255, 230, 255)
        Note over Client,S3: Flow 4: Training Job Submission
        Client->>GRPC: Train request (gRPC/8085)<br/>or POST (HTTP/8080)
        GRPC->>Wrapper: Route to GlobalTrainServicer
        Wrapper->>Train: Train(request)
        Train->>MM: train(module_class, params)
        MM->>MM: LocalModelTrainer<br/>(thread or subprocess)
        MM->>Module: ModuleBase.train()
        Module->>S3: Read training data<br/>HTTPS/443 AWS IAM
        S3-->>Module: training data
        Module->>Module: train model
        Module->>Module: ModuleBase.save()
        Train-->>Wrapper: training_id
        Wrapper-->>GRPC: TrainingJob response
        GRPC-->>Client: training_id

        Note over Client,MM: Later: check training status
        Client->>GRPC: GetTrainingStatus(training_id)
        GRPC->>Wrapper: Route to TrainingManagementServicer
        Wrapper-->>GRPC: TrainingStatus (RUNNING/COMPLETED/FAILED)
        GRPC-->>Client: status response
    end

    rect rgb(245, 245, 245)
        Note over GRPC,OTLP: Continuous: Observability
        GRPC->>OTLP: OTLP traces<br/>gRPC/4317 or HTTP/4318<br/>TLS/mTLS configurable
        Prom-->>Prom: Expose metrics<br/>rpc_in_progress_gauge<br/>predict_rpc_count
    end
